id=abxytweaks
name=abxylute One tweaks (adb root, fixed adb port, vendor bloat off, schedutil, recents fix)
version=v4
versionCode=4
author=karl0ss
description=Grants adb shell root once (Magisk root_access=Apps and ADB), wireless adb on fixed port 5555, disables the vendor settings app's OTA service, telemetry receiver and feature provider, hides the persistent vendor keyguard app, CPU governor performance -> schedutil, clears the vendor gamepad-mode flag so recents works (unused with the phone SystemUI module). Log: /data/local/tmp/abxytweaks.log
